<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God is my retreat,</l><l>I’m the pupil of His eye.</l><l>My crag, my rock, my shield,</l><l>My strength is God in Him I lie.</l><l>The shadow of His wings</l><l>Is now the place I hide;</l><l>His presence here, my comfort here,</l><l>All by one simple word.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God, I know one thing:</l><l>You’re the song within my heart.</l><l>You are a boundless stream,</l><l>You flow in me to my delight.</l><l>Oh just fill me now,</l><l>Satisfaction’s in Your life.</l><l>I want to stay, here with You,</l><l>Salvation’s in Your name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
